Immutability isn’t about being inflexible.

It’s one promise, kept: what’s recorded stays recorded, and apps can’t be stopped.

→ Supply: set in 2017, hasn’t changed
→ History: no hard fork has ever reversed a transaction
→ Upgrades: public ECIPs, open to anyone

Decentralized. Immutable. Unstoppable.